# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#   https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
# Syntax: a URL pattern, then indented "Name: value" lines. Limits are 100
# rules and 2,000 characters per line, so this is nowhere near them.
#
# X-Robots-Tag does what a <meta name="robots"> tag cannot: it applies to the
# PHOTOS too. A meta tag only exists inside HTML, so image files would still be
# indexable without this.
#
#   noindex       do not list this in search results
#   nofollow      do not follow links out of it
#   noarchive     do not keep a cached copy
#   nosnippet     do not show an extract in results
#   noimageindex  do not index the images
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
